{
  "$comment": [
    "Status verbs shown while the agent works, picked by what the user asked.",
    "",
    "All entries are gerunds on purpose. 'Agent is working...' is a status",
    "sentence; 'Untangling...' is a status verb, and reads as the system doing",
    "something right now rather than being stuck.",
    "",
    "Tone is not uniform, and that is deliberate. The diagnose and secrets",
    "buckets are flat and literal because they appear when something is broken",
    "or when credentials are involved -- whimsy there reads as flippant. The",
    "playful entries live in buckets where nothing is on fire."
  ],
  "categories": {
    "generic": {
      "match": [],
      "verbs": [
        "Thinking", "Working", "Considering", "Processing", "Reasoning",
        "Puzzling", "Mulling", "Pondering", "Chewing", "Noodling",
        "Percolating", "Ruminating", "Cogitating", "Deliberating", "Weighing",
        "Turning it over", "Lining things up", "Joining the dots",
        "Following the thread", "Getting there", "Warming up", "Spinning up",
        "Making sense of it", "Sorting it out", "Piecing it together",
        "Getting oriented", "Taking stock", "Reading the room",
        "Doing the rounds", "Working the problem", "Chasing it down",
        "Sizing it up", "Casting about", "Rummaging", "Beavering away",
        "Cranking", "Whirring", "Ticking over", "Marshalling", "Assembling"
      ]
    },
    "deploy": {
      "match": [
        "deploy", "ship", "release", "rollout", "roll out", "launch",
        "promote", "publish", "go live", "restart", "scale", "rollback"
      ],
      "verbs": [
