        "Caching wisely", "Pinning versions", "Resolving dependencies",
        "Measuring twice", "Drafting", "Sketching", "Shaping", "Whittling",
        "Fitting the pieces", "Tightening bolts", "Squaring corners",
        "Sanding edges", "Packing", "Compressing", "Bolting things together",
